 ## [Unreleased]
+### Added
+- The v2 Check query executor now reports datastore query count and item count as histogram observations and span attributes, and records whether the request was datastore-throttled. It also accepts a maximum concurrent reads limit and a datastore throttling configuration (enabled flag, threshold, and duration).
 
